# Utility Libraries and Services

Utility functions and services are organized in [src/lib](mdc:src/lib):

- [src/lib/config](mdc:src/lib/config) - Application configuration
- [src/lib/services](mdc:src/lib/services) - Service layer implementations
- [src/lib/strava](mdc:src/lib/strava) - Strava API integration
- [src/lib/utils](mdc:src/lib/utils) - Common utility functions

These modules should be:
1. Focused on a single responsibility
2. Well-tested and reusable
3. Free of UI or presentation logic
